        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Virgo — 2nd Technique, gained at level 6.</em></p><p>Clarity of Mind — the wheel of dharma turning, clarity offered outward.</p><p>You and your allies in the emanation gain a +1 status bonus to Will saves and to saves against mental effects, and are immune to the fascinated and frightened conditions, for 1 minute.</p><p>When you cast this Technique, a card offers every mental effect on a creature in the area; choosing one counteracts it with your Cosmo statistic.</p><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The emanation increases by 5 feet. At 12th level the bonus becomes +2 and the immunity extends to confused; at 18th level the bonus becomes +3.</p><p><em>On a day your constellation is Ascendant this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a Zenith, 8 levels higher.</em></p>"
        },
